### NIN Verification API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/nin-verification

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Verify NIN (Valid)
POST {{apiUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nin": "12345678901"
}

### 2. Verify NIN (Invalid - not 11 digits)
POST {{apiUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nin": "123"
}

### 3. Verify NIN (Invalid - contains letters)
POST {{apiUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nin": "1234567890A"
}

### 4. Verify NIN (Missing NIN)
POST {{apiUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test"
}

### 5. Get All NIN Verifications (Admin Only - requires auth token)
GET {{apiUrl}}?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Get Cache Statistics (Admin Only)
GET {{apiUrl}}/cache/stats
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Get Specific NIN Verification (Admin Only)
GET {{apiUrl}}/12345678901
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 8. Clear NIN Cache (Admin Only)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/cache/12345678901
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

